  <data key="d2">Nothing Ear is a device provided by Nothing for consumer use.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Ear is another name for the earbuds produced by the Nothing company.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Ear refers to earphones produced by Nothing, an organization known for its tech products.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Ear refers to the audio accessory products from the organization Nothing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nothing Ear are wireless earbuds produced by the Nothing organization, designed to pair with the Nothing Phone.</data>
