<node id="Apple">
  <data key="d0">Apple</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Apple Inc., a renowned technology company known for its advanced secure systems and services like Find My iPhone, iCloud, iOS operating system, Privacy Settings, and Face ID, offers an array of products including iPhones, iPads, Mac computers, Apple Watches, AirPods Pro, and Ear (stick). The organization has developed the iOS operating system that is compatible with CMF Watch Pro versions 13 and above. Apple takes pride in its advanced battery technology featured in their earbud product line.

Apple's contribution to this context involves integrating its devices with enhanced features, providing platform support for communication between iPhones and CMF Watches enabling functionalities like notifications and firmware updates. The company also offers device tracking and security services through Find My Phone and AirTag. Apple is recognized for including features such as Dark Theme, Night Shift, True Tone, and other accessibility enhancements on their devices.

Moreover, it's worth mentioning that Apple has taken over the production of Ear (stick), now manufacturing AirPods Pro which provide features previously offered by Nothing's earbud solutions. As a whole, Apple showcases its commitment to innovation across various technological domains while ensuring user privacy and security.</data>
