  <data key="d2">The iPhone is a series of smartphones designed and marketed by Apple Inc., encompassing various models such as the iPhone SE, iPhone 13 Pro, and iPhone Mini. These devices are a product line developed by Apple for smartphones that operate on iOS. In certain contexts, particularly when discussing data transfer operations, iPhones are specifically mentioned alongside other devices like the Nothing Phone. Thus, an iPhone can be seen both as an Apple product capable of transferring data to another device (such as the Nothing Phone) and part of Apple's comprehensive line of smartphones which also includes models like the 13 Pro and Mini, all of them running on iOS operating system.</data>
