Google Fast Pair is a feature designed for quick and seamless pairing of devices with Android phones. Specifically, it enables easy connection between compatible devices such as the CMF Buds Pro 2 and other Google-enabled devices. This feature is supported by products like the Buds Pro earbuds, which are tailored for use with Android devices, enhancing the overall user experience through efficient connectivity.</data>
