Microsoft Swift Pair is a feature designed to enable quick, rapid, and seamless device connections with Microsoft products, particularly for use with Windows 10 or newer operating systems. It simplifies the pairing process, allowing users to easily connect devices such as CMF Buds Pro 2 earbuds or other compatible hardware to their Windows devices. This feature ensures a fast and straightforward experience for users looking to pair their Microsoft Swift Pair-supported devices.</data>
