<node id="Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)">
  <data key="d0">Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) is a notable feature found across various devices such as Samsung Galaxy Buds Pro, CMF Buds 2, Nothing Ear (a), Apple's earbuds, and headphones or earbuds in general. ANC significantly improves sound quality by reducing background noise, thereby enhancing the listening experience.

This technology enables superior audio performance in devices like Samsung Galaxy Buds Pro, effectively minimizing external disturbances for a more pristine output. Similarly, CMF Buds 2 utilizes ANC with impressive noise reduction capabilities up to 48dB, offering a highly immersive audio environment that can be customized via the Nothing X app according to user preferences.

Apple's earbuds incorporate ANC technology too; this feature optimizes battery life by efficiently managing power consumption during use, ensuring an uninterrupted listening experience. Multiple modes are available with ANC-enabled earbuds from Apple, catering to diverse user needs and enhancing audio quality for playback.

The ANC feature found in the Nothing Ear (a) also focuses on noise reduction for improved sound clarity without compromising battery efficiency. Lastly, headphones that support ANC provide a robust solution against unwanted background noise, allowing users to enjoy an immersive auditory experience free of external distractions. This advanced technology is implemented across various devices and platforms aiming to optimize user experience by creating clearer audio environments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1843631bbc6580a0ba48e4e755c7d90a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cee36f037b16e514d6f9086c8c3fd508&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8c347cbb4b796bbb29c806e9e99eddd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7364ab83705a79b680c9d2b3c59dfc14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-015d7b184cab5d36ebe7d23a9b8456aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20dc5db5b79c17dfa8cfd7837f6cc25d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e09ed589cc63a314f21cd40d0f894934&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbdfc5c6de67f3cbf3c7b03caad41ac5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c58a1bef8840fb18692c87c343bce6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb6838e11cc8329a0e8449a9e3051202</data>
