<node id="Bluetooth 5.3">
  <data key="d0">Bluetooth 5.3</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Bluetooth 5.3 is a wireless communication standard employed by various high-tech devices such as CMF Buds Pro earbuds, Nothing Ear Stick earbuds, CMF Watch Pro, and the Ear (open). This technology supports stable audio transmission when connected to other devices like headphones or smartwatches. The improved version of Bluetooth provides better connectivity and range compared to its previous versions.

Bluetooth 5.3 has been integrated into the watch's design to optimize wireless headphone connections, allowing for an enhanced listening experience with improved sound quality and connectivity features.

The CMF Buds utilize this protocol to enable seamless connection to other devices while ensuring high-quality wireless audio transmission that is reliable and stable.

Similarly, Nothing Ear Stick earbuds incorporate Bluetooth 5.3 technology for smooth device connectivity and a consistent audio streaming experience.

In addition, the CMF Watch Pro employs Bluetooth version with enhanced wireless communication capabilities, which now supports headphones for better audio performance during usage.

Lastly, the version of Bluetooth technology utilized by both CMF Buds and Ear (open) devices is highlighted, underscoring their commitment to providing superior connectivity features that contribute to overall user satisfaction in terms of audio quality and seamless device integration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bbe38a86de701a84c6998b00199044c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1843631bbc6580a0ba48e4e755c7d90a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-646111b11cebdb18956a6d772cfd3b0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-458fb6678632e1a5048fc67fa95a614a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e527ebc82d3e91d040743f1b3884d81&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba4a173727fcedbbf9dce45223eb141c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-293dd3fa358d02dc41fab0ae8c45601c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-897b02be6338c451781211c772802b2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff17b5eefa112f81cc3460c2e51f9340</data>
