<node id="Buds Pro Earbuds">
  <data key="d0">Buds Pro Earbuds</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Buds Pro are earbuds that used to be validated by Nothing but are now under the scrutiny of Innovative Sound Processing for their sound quality and performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Buds Pro is a specific model of earbuds that incorporates advanced features such as water resistance and enhanced audio quality.&lt;SEP&gt;The Buds Pro earbuds are a product with advanced audio features, including ANC, ENC, and support for various audio formats.&lt;SEP&gt;The Buds Pro earbuds are audio devices developed by Nothing, which undergo testing procedures to ensure performance quality.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2bdbe5c98c9cda101396ccd8faeaf9db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9718b07353b800ec520615d9b91a82ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec428f7da1f77a60d558af35b7b65f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3b3089d626c59a7ef8835afdfb37254</data>
