<node id="Buds">
  <data key="d0">Buds</data>
  <data key="d1">device</data>
  <data key="d2">The Buds are wireless earbuds with features like fast charging, support for AAC and SBC audio formats, and multiple equalizer settings. They also support Google Fast Pair but do not support LE Audio or wireless charging.</data>
