<node id="App Store">
  <data key="d0">App Store</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The App Store is an application store operated by Apple Inc., which serves as Apple's platform for digital distribution, providing access to millions of applications and services available for download on iOS devices. It offers a vast collection of apps suitable for various purposes, including the Nothing X app. Designed specifically for iOS users, the App Store enables them to conveniently download and install the desired applications directly onto their devices.</data>
