  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A feature that disables wireless functions like WiFi, Bluetooth, and cellular data when enabled.&lt;SEP&gt;A setting that disables wireless connections like Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and cellular data.&lt;SEP&gt;Airplane Mode disables wireless functions like Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and cellular data.&lt;SEP&gt;Airplane Mode is a setting that disables all wireless connections on a smartphone, including WiFi, Bluetooth, and cellular data.</data>
