<node id="SIM card">
  <data key="d0">SIM card</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A SIM card is a small chip used in mobile devices to identify and authenticate subscribers on a wireless network.&lt;SEP&gt;A SIM card is used in mobile phones and may affect network connectivity and performance.&lt;SEP&gt;A component in mobile phone that interacts with network services, primarily used by Noah Carter to break 100m sprint record.</data>
