<node id="SIM Card">
  <data key="d0">SIM Card</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A SIM card is an essential component for mobile communication, enabling network connectivity and services.&lt;SEP&gt;A SIM card is required to enable mobile data connectivity on the phone, including features like data roaming and making calls.&lt;SEP&gt;A component used in the Nothing Phone (1) to connect to mobile networks, supporting dual SIM functionality with specific network usage rules.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0bc06dd49360390a6e53f8e372263fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c847f86484163ad737019641d7c679ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ce7e7aa65be78b99ef2394ed5163677</data>
