<node id="Factory Settings">
  <data key="d0">Factory Settings</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Factory settings are default configurations of a device as it was when first sold, often used as a reset point for troubleshooting.&lt;SEP&gt;Factory settings are default configurations of a device that can be restored to troubleshoot issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Factory settings are the default configurations of the phone, often restored during troubleshooting to resolve software-related issues.</data>
