<node id="Nothing Customer Service">
  <data key="d0">Nothing Customer Service</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Nothing Customer Service provides support and assistance for users of Nothing products.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Customer Service provides support and replacements for their products.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Customer Service provides support for users encountering issues with Nothing devices, including firmware updates, feature compatibility, and troubleshooting.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Customer Service provides support for users experiencing issues with the Nothing Ear product.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing Customer Service provides support for users of Nothing products, including assistance with product features and troubleshooting.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9753259336cc9a777d0bba61da3a498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04f1d237a15c514829a74803891d536f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ec2f81516f2860cb39745bfab9ea802&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e061fc43e43423254a79260a66f63516&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2a9c4419d0d3ab7a355fe65d33c609f</data>
