<node id="iOS">
  <data key="d0">iOS</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">iOS is Apple's mobile operating system, supporting features like voice assistance and app downloads for the earbuds.&lt;SEP&gt;iOS is an operating system for Apple devices where certain applications, such as the Nothing X app, are available.&lt;SEP&gt;iOS is the mobile operating system developed by Apple Inc., used in iPhones and iPads.&lt;SEP&gt;iOS is the mobile operating system developed by Apple, supporting features like Activation Lock and Privacy Settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a16160dd90bba4a1db38925a09b3d8d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df8db3beef512b88e164b7ead03f628a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9753259336cc9a777d0bba61da3a498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e09ed589cc63a314f21cd40d0f894934</data>
