</node>
<node id="Factory Reset">
  <data key="d0">Factory Reset</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A factory reset is the process of restoring the Nothing Phone 1 to its original state, which erases all data on the phone.&lt;SEP&gt;Factory Reset is a process where a device's settings are restored to their original state, often used to troubleshoot technical issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Restoring the phone to its original state by erasing all data, requiring a backup beforehand.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9753259336cc9a777d0bba61da3a498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adccabe86abea83b0bd02d87519d4e56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93f6edcfacec45092a9cf547de8b797c</data>
