</node>
<node id="Charging Issues">
  <data key="d0">Charging Issues</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Charging Issues encompass problems related to charging devices via USB-C or USB-A ports.&lt;SEP&gt;Charging Issues refer to problems users encounter while charging devices, such as slow charging or failure to charge properly.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9753259336cc9a777d0bba61da3a498&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db7c36ff1bab974f88932118ab35f6af</data>
