  <data key="d0">Firmware Update</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Addresses Bluetooth issues and enhances device functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Firmware Update is a type of software update that improves device functionality and performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Software updates that enhance device performance and features.</data>
