  <data key="d2">Transparency Mode allows users to hear their surroundings while listening to music, enhancing situational awareness.&lt;SEP&gt;Transparency Mode is available on Apple's earbuds, enabling users to hear their surroundings while still using the earbuds. This feature enhances user convenience and safety.&lt;SEP&gt;Transparency mode allows users to hear their surroundings while using earbuds, enhancing safety and user convenience.</data>
