<node id="Google Assistant">
  <data key="d0">Google Assistant</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Google Assistant is an AI-powered virtual assistant service provided by Google, designed for managing various device features and capabilities through voice commands or applications. This intelligent assistant responds to user requests, performs tasks, and provides relevant information when prompted by voice commands. It serves as a versatile tool that activates compatible device functionalities upon activation. Contrary to the description about triggering the Glyph interface on Nothing Phone 1 specifically, it should be noted that Google Assistant is generally applicable across multiple devices and platforms, rather than being exclusive to specific hardware like the Nothing Phone 1's Glyph system.</data>
