  <data key="d0">App Pinning</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">App Pinning is a feature that keeps an app visible until it is unpinned, allowing personal data to be accessible.&lt;SEP&gt;App pinning is a feature that keeps an app visible until unpinned, potentially allowing access to personal data and other apps.&lt;SEP&gt;App pinning keeps an app active on the screen until unpinned, useful for multitasking or temporarily restricting access to other apps.</data>
