<node id="Dark Theme">
  <data key="d0">Dark Theme</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A Dark Theme is a display setting designed for phones which transforms the device's user interface into a dark mode. This feature serves multiple purposes including color inversion to alleviate eye strain and potentially extend battery life. By changing the display theme to dark, users benefit from enhanced visibility in low-light conditions and reduced eye fatigue. Additionally, adopting this setting optimizes battery usage by employing a darker interface that may require less power for backlighting compared to traditional lighter themes.</data>
