<node id="Samsung">
  <data key="d0">Samsung</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Samsung integrates Google services into their smartphones to enhance user experience and security, offering a suite of features including multiple user profiles, Bixby voice assistant, Samsung DeX, Samsung Pay, Samsung Health, and Samsung Knox for improved functionality and enhanced protection. As a global technology company producing electronic products like smartphones, televisions, and appliances, Samsung is also recognized as a leading manufacturer of Android devices, collaborating with Nothing Phone to further improve user experience. In addition to their range of Galaxy Buds, which feature wireless charging, water resistance, long battery life, and advanced Bluetooth connectivity, Samsung now produces CMF Buds 2 and Galaxy Buds Pro, demonstrating their commitment to innovation in the field of audio technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84a339c38ed23d0b26b7efa34e0e7311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65675ae55cc90cede6179f63680c5665&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8c347cbb4b796bbb29c806e9e99eddd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2579eed5f0b874364e3b49d4375b30b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf69cc62c0a329c8e3c66816e77e3320&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbdfc5c6de67f3cbf3c7b03caad41ac5</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1751270806</data>
</node>
