<node id="Bluetooth 5.0">
  <data key="d0">Bluetooth 5.0</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Bluetooth 5.0 is a key feature of the Wireless Audio Device, which enhances its connectivity and range for LDAC.&lt;SEP&gt;Bluetooth 5.0 is a wireless technology required for the Sony LDAC app to function, enabling high-definition audio encoding when connected to compatible Android phones.</data>
