  <data key="d0">Voice Assistant Integration</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Voice Assistant Integration allows controlling headphones with voice commands.&lt;SEP&gt;Voice Assistant Integration enables hands-free operation through Bluetooth 5.3 connection.&lt;SEP&gt;Voice Assistant Integration is provided by the TWSiM Pro, allowing hands-free control of the Neckband Pro.</data>
