  <data key="d0">Multi-Device Pairing</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Allows seamless connection of earbuds to multiple devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-Device Pairing is supported by the TWSiM Pro, enabling seamless switching between devices for the Neckband Pro.</data>
