  <data key="d6">18.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The Watch Pro includes a feature to measure stress levels when worn correctly and remaining still.&lt;SEP&gt;The Watch Pro offers a built-in stress measurement feature for user health monitoring.</data>
  <data key="d8">device functionality,health features,health monitoring,product functionality</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-7cb7e5bf8aff3e96b2bd9a9da80699e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5536d7660e4d588225e443f11a6df418</data>
